sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Router
    participant P as Prefill group
    participant A as Decode attention group
    participant F as Remote experts
    R->>P: Evaluate the prompt
    R->>A: Identify request and reserve cache slots
    P->>P: Sample the first output token
    P-->>R: First token for streaming in this example
    P-->>A: Prompt KV and continuation metadata including sampled ID
    Note over P,A: One logical PD handoff can involve many block transfers
    A-->>P: Transfer complete and safe to release source
    loop Decode until stop
        loop Each remotely executed MoE layer
            A->>A: Attend with resident KV and select experts
            A->>F: Dispatch rows with routing metadata
            F->>F: Permute rows into expert batches and evaluate
            F-->>A: Return contributions for combine in source order
            A->>A: Apply scaling and residual per model
        end
        A->>A: Sample the next token
        A-->>R: Stream available output
    end
    A->>A: Release request ownership
